# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
#
# `cmake -S . -B build` puts it in build/. colcon builds from a workspace
# outside this repository, but run from in here by mistake it would create
# build/, install/ and log/ at the root.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/build/
/install/
/log/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated CANopen configuration
#
# dcfgen produces these from bus.yml plus each node's EDS on every build, so
# they are output, not source. bus.yml and the .eds files ARE source and are
# committed: they are the description the master is built from, and without
# them the network cannot be regenerated.
#
# master.resolved.dcf is written at run time by CanBus, which rewrites the
# UploadFile paths in master.dcf to absolute ones.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
master.dcf
master.bin
master.resolved.dcf
*.bin
!**/config/**/*.eds

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendor documentation
#
# The EPOS4 manuals are freely downloadable from maxongroup.com and total
# ~14 MB of binary that would sit in the history forever. Keep them locally,
# out of the repository:
#
#   EPOS4 Firmware Specification   the object dictionary, the state machine,
#                                  the operating modes, the error tables
#   EPOS4 Communication Guide      CANopen framing and the COB-ID allocation
#
# Drop this section if the team would rather have them versioned alongside
# the code that references them by page number.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/resources/*.pdf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.vscode/browse.vc.db*
.vscode/ipch/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.cache/
compile_commands.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build and debug leftovers
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.so.*
core
core.*
vgcore.*
*.gcda
*.gcno
*.gcov
perf.data*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

HANDOFF.md
